  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the refractive index <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>μ</mi></mfenced></math> of the material of the prism is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation (1), it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>"
